OL,3,GNEWSAWarning of traffic delays during
OL,4,Awork in Inverness city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FHighland Council has warned of the
OL,7,Fpotential for traffic delays in
OL,8,FInverness during five days of work
OL,9,Faround one of the city's busiest
OL,10,Fjunctions next month.
OL,12,FCommunications company Openreach is to
OL,13,Flay new ducts for cables at the
OL,14,Fjunction of Bridge Street, Bank Street,
OL,15,FCastle Road, and Ness Bridge.
OL,17,FThe work in the city centre is
OL,18,Fscheduled to run from 16 to 20
OL,19,FNovember. The local authority
OL,20,Fpreviously said the work was to be
OL,21,Fcarried out in October.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
