OL,3,GNEWSAWarning of traffic delays during
OL,4,Awork in Inverness city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said there would be
OL,7,F"extensive" traffic management in
OL,8,Fplace, and motorists should use
OL,9,Falternative routes if possible.
